  "prefLabel": "Ncr 1107.03 Notification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 1107.03 Notification. After submitting an application in accordance with Ncr 1107.02, the following procedure shall occur:\n\n(a) All applications shall be reviewed according to the reasons set forth in Ncr 1107.01 and either be approved or denied within 30 days after receipt of application; and\n\n(b) Should the application be denied, the department shall provide written reasons explaining how the application does not comply with Ncr 1107.01.\n\nSource. #5927, eff 11-22-94, EXPIRED: 11-22-00\n\nNew. #7507, eff 6-21-01; ss by #9479, eff 6-1-09, EXPIRED: 6-1-17\n\nNew. #12825, INTERIM, eff 7-10-19, EXPIRES: 1-6-20",
